Chess piece artwork notice

The bundled 1-bit Celtic chess piece artwork in ChessPieces.h is derived from
"celtic" by Maurizio Monge, https://github.com/maurimo/chess-art, under the
MIT License. Copyright (c) Maurizio Monge. The original bitmap assets and
this notice are retained with the adaptation.

Unicode chess-symbol glyphs

ChessPieces.h now embeds monochrome rasterizations of the standard chess
symbols U+2654 through U+265F from Noto Sans Symbols 2. The font and its full
SIL Open Font License 1.1 are preserved in assets_local/chess_symbols/.
Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors.

